ed a policy of containment to stop the spread of communism, which included providing military and economic aid to countries resisting communism and intervening in conflicts. This policy was implemented through various foreign policies, including the Truman Doctrine, the Marshall Plan, the Eisenhower Doctrine, and later the Kennedy Doctrine, as well as sponsoring and facilitating state terrorism."}, {"question": "in the u.s. economy the money supply is controlled by the quizlet", "src": [["banks", "through", "the", "money", "multiplier", "mechanism", "."], ["One", "textbook", "summarizes", "the", "process", "as", "follows", ":", "``", "The", "Fed", "''", "controls", "the", "money", "supply", "in", "the", "United", "States", "by", "controlling", "the", "amount", "of", "loans", "made", "by", "commercial", "banks", "."], ["New", "loans", "are", "usually", "in", "the", "form", "of", "increased", "checking", "account", "balances", ",", "and", "since", "checkable", "deposits", "are", "part", "of", "the", "money", "supply", ",", "the", "money", "supply", "increases", "when", "new", "loans", "are", "made", "..."], ["This", "type", "of", "money", "is", "convertible", "into", "cash", "when", "depositors", "request", "cash", "withdrawals", ",", "which", "will", "require", "banks", "to", "limit", "or", "reduce", "their", "lending", "."], ["The", "vast", "majority", "of", "the", "broad", "money", "supply", "throughout", "the", "world", "representsbe", "controlled", "."], ["If", "money", "is", "a", "commodity", "to", "be", "traded", ",", "then", "all", "that", "matters", "is", "that", "the", "money", "is", "100", "%", "backed", "by", "some", "commodity", ",", "like", "gold", "or", "silver", "for", "example", "."], ["If", "money", "is", "credit", ",", "then", "it", "makes", "sense", "that", "bankers", "control", "it", ",", "as", "they", "do", "in", "the", "United", "States", "today", "."], ["But", "if", "money", "is", "an", "artifact", "of", "law", ",", "whose", "value", "is", "der